x="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="65" width="990" height="35" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase1_p1_1" parent="phase1_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;1.1 Multi-Source Hardware Profile Ingestion (WindTurbineProfile.from_plant_profile)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.5;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Input Sources:&lt;/b&gt; S3 Plant Profile JSON, AWS Environment Variables, Dynamic Configuration.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Dataclass Attributes:&lt;/b&gt; rated_capacity_mw, hub_height_m, rotor_diameter_m, num_turbines, ramp_exponent.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Turbine Hardware Sizing:&lt;/b&gt; Supports 2.0 MW to 5.0 MW low-wind &amp; high-hub utility machines.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Swept Area Formula:&lt;/b&gt; A = &amp;pi; &amp;middot; D&amp;sup2; / 4 (e.g. 10,207 m&amp;sup2; for 114m rotor, up to 26,015 m&amp;sup2; for 182m rotor).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Fault Isolation:&lt;/b&gt; Dedicated site environment variables with zero cross-plant dependency.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="115" width="990" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase1_p1_2" parent="phase1_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;1.2 Aerodynamic Operating Velocity Limits (IEC Class IIIA/S)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;table style='width:100%; font-size:11px; color:#0F172A; border-collapse:collapse;'&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#F1F5F9; color:#0F172A; font-weight:bold;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #CBD5E1;'&gt;Parameter&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #CBD5E1;'&gt;Value / Range&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #CBD5E1;'&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Aerodynamic Function&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#FFFFFF;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cut-in Speed (v_cut_in)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;3.0 m/s&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;Minimum velocity to overcome mechanical friction &amp; produce positive torque.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#F8FAFC;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rated Speed (v_rated)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;10.5 – 11.5 m/s&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;Full aerodynamic nameplate generation ceiling; active blade pitch regulation active.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#FFFFFF;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cut-out Speed (v_cut_out)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;25.0 m/s&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;Storm protection feathering and high-wind mechanical braking shut-off.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#F8FAFC;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ramp Exponent (k)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;2.8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;Cubic power curve ramp coefficient between cut-in and rated plateaus.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="270" width="990" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase1_p1_3" parent="phase1_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=15;spacingRight=15;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13.5px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;1.3 Combined Three-Factor Park Derate Formulation (&amp;eta;_park)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #CBD5E1; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='background:#F8FAFC; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:7px; border-radius:4px; font-family:monospace; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A; margin:6px 0; font-size:13px; text-align:center;'&gt;&amp;eta;_park = &amp;eta;_wake &amp;times; &amp;eta;_elec &amp;times; &amp;eta;_avail = 0.94 &amp;times; 0.98 &amp;times; 0.97 &amp;approx; 0.89 (~11% Total Farm Derate)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11.5px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.55; margin-top:5px;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Aerodynamic Wake Deficit (&amp;eta;_wake = 0.94):&lt;/b&gt; Mutual rotor turbulence and velocity reduction across turbine rows.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Electrical Collection Efficiency (&amp;eta;_elec = 0.98):&lt;/b&gt; Medium-voltage internal collection cables, step-up transformers, and switchyard impedance.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Hardware Availability Factor (&amp;eta;_avail = 0.97):&lt;/b&gt; Scheduled maintenance, transient grid drops, and yaw/pitch tracking calibration.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="465" width="990" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase1_p1_4" parent="phase1_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;1.4 Empirical Site Calibrated Multipliers (96-Block Array)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.5;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Function:&lt;/b&gt; load_site_calibrated_multipliers(plant_name)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Storage Key:&lt;/b&gt; plant_profiles/&amp;lt;site&amp;gt;_calibrated_multipliers.json&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Array Length:&lt;/b&gt; 96 float multipliers (one per 15-minute block) derived from historic revenue meter reconciliations.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Micro-Climate Alignment:&lt;/b&gt; Compensates for complex local topography, terrain roughness, and micro-climatic hills.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="660" width="990" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase2_container" parent="1" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2.5;startSize=50;arcSize=6;shadow=1;collapsible=0;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px; color:#065F46;&quot;&gt;PHASE 2: THERMODYNAMIC AIR DENSITY &amp; KINETIC WIND FLUX ENGINE&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="140" width="1040" height="2200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase2_pill" parent="phase2_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D1FAE5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#065F46;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12.5;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" value="MODULE CONTEXT: compute_air_density() &amp; IEC 61400-12 Density-Normalized Effective Velocity" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="65" width="990" height="35" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase2_p2_1" parent="phase2_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;2.1 Atmospheric Thermodynamic Ingestion (Surface Pressure &amp; Temperature)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.5;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Query Parameters:&lt;/b&gt; surface_pressure (hPa) &amp; temperature_2m (&amp;deg;C) at site latitude/longitude coordinates.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Barometric Elevation Clamps:&lt;/b&gt; P &amp;isin; [700.0, 1100.0] hPa (reflecting site elevation up to 500m ASL).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Absolute Temperature Clamps:&lt;/b&gt; T &amp;isin; [-33.15, 56.85] &amp;deg;C (T_kelvin &amp;isin; [240.0, 330.0] K).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Ideal Gas Constant:&lt;/b&gt; R_spec = 287.05 J/(kg&amp;middot;K) for dry atmospheric air.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="115" width="990" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase2_p2_2" parent="phase2_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=15;spacingRight=15;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13.5px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;2.2 Thermodynamic Air Density Formulation (&amp;rho;)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #CBD5E1; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='background:#F8FAFC; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:7px; border-radius:4px; font-family:monospace; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A; margin:6px 0; font-size:13px; text-align:center;'&gt;&amp;rho; = (P &amp;times; 100) / [ R_spec &amp;times; (T_2m + 273.15) ]   [kg/m&amp;sup3;]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11.5px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.55; margin-top:5px;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Standard Sea-Level Reference:&lt;/b&gt; &amp;rho;_0 = 1.225 kg/m&amp;sup3; at 1013.25 hPa and 15.0 &amp;deg;C.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;High-Altitude / Summer Thinning:&lt;/b&gt; In hot plateau climates (&amp;gt;35&amp;deg;C, ~960 hPa), density falls to ~1.08 kg/m&amp;sup3;.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Cold Nocturnal Thickening:&lt;/b&gt; Night air increases density to ~1.20 kg/m&amp;sup3;, generating ~11% more kinetic power at identical speeds.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="270" width="990" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase2_p2_3" parent="phase2_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=15;spacingRight=15;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13.5px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;2.3 IEC 61400-12 Density-Normalized Wind Velocity (v_eff)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #CBD5E1; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='background:#F8FAFC; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:7px; border-radius:4px; font-family:monospace; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A; margin:6px 0; font-size:13px; text-align:center;'&gt;v_eff = v_hub &amp;times; [ &amp;rho; / 1.225 ]^(1/3)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11.5px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.55; margin-top:5px;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Kinetic Energy Normalization:&lt;/b&gt; Adjusts effective aerodynamic velocity for kinetic variation due to air thinning at higher site temperatures.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Density Ratio Clamp:&lt;/b&gt; max(0.70, min(1.30, &amp;rho; / 1.225)) prevents non-physical mathematical anomalies.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Empirical Power Curve Drop-in:&lt;/b&gt; Evaluates standard manufacturer power curve without requiring site re-calibration curves.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="465" width="990" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase2_p2_4" parent="phase2_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;2.4 96-Block Density Spline Array&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.5;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Hourly Resolution:&lt;/b&gt; Calculates hourly air densities for hours 0 through 23.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;15-Min Spline:&lt;/b&gt; Interpolates using np.interp to 96 discrete block densities: &amp;rho;(b).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Downstream Role:&lt;/b&gt; Passed directly to Phase 6 for each quarter-hour power conversion.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="650" width="990" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase3_container" parent="1" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEFCE8;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2.5;startSize=50;arcSize=6;shadow=1;collapsible=0;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px; color:#92400E;&quot;&gt;PHASE 3: 143-MEMBER MULTI-AGENCY NWP ENSEMBLE &amp; DIURNAL SHEAR&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2420" y="140" width="1040" height="2200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase3_pill" parent="phase3_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#92400E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12.5;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" value="MODULE CONTEXT: fetch_wind_ensemble_weather() :: ECMWF, ICON, GEFS, GEM &amp; Boundary Layer Shear" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="65" width="990" height="35" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase3_p3_1" parent="phase3_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;3.1 143-Member Multi-Agency Super-Ensemble Ingestion&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;table style='width:100%; font-size:11px; color:#0F172A; border-collapse:collapse;'&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#F1F5F9; color:#0F172A; font-weight:bold;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #CBD5E1;'&gt;Parameter&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #CBD5E1;'&gt;Value / Range&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #CBD5E1;'&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Aerodynamic Function&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#FFFFFF;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;ECMWF (Europe)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;IFS-EPS (ifs025) 51 members&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;25 km native grid; highest overall synoptic trajectory accuracy.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#F8FAFC;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;DWD (Germany)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;ICON-Seamless 40 members&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;13 km resolution; superior planetary boundary layer shear modeling.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#FFFFFF;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOAA (USA)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;GEFS-Seamless 31 members&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;25 km resolution; robust convective diurnal spread quantification.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#F8FAFC;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CMC (Canada)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;GEM-Seamless 21 members&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;39 km resolution; long-wave frontal system validation.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="115" width="990" height="175" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase3_p3_2" parent="phase3_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=15;spacingRight=15;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13.5px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;3.2 Diurnal Atmospheric Boundary Layer Shear Scaling&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #CBD5E1; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='background:#F8FAFC; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:7px; border-radius:4px; font-family:monospace; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A; margin:6px 0; font-size:13px; text-align:center;'&gt;v_hub(h) = v_ref(h) &amp;times; [ Hub_Height / H_ref ]^&amp;alpha;(h)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11.5px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.55; margin-top:5px;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Power-Law Shear Scaling:&lt;/b&gt; Elevates 10m surface winds or intermediate anemometers to 80m–140m hub centerlines.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Diurnal Shear Exponent Profile (&amp;alpha;):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Nocturnal Inversion (21:00 – 05:00 IST):&lt;/b&gt; &amp;alpha; = &lt;b&gt;0.29&lt;/b&gt; (Strong vertical decoupling &amp; upper jet)&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Morning Transition (06:00 – 07:00 IST):&lt;/b&gt; &amp;alpha; = &lt;b&gt;0.20&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Daytime Solar Convection (08:00 – 17:00 IST):&lt;/b&gt; &amp;alpha; = &lt;b&gt;0.12&lt;/b&gt; (Turbulent boundary layer mixing)&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Evening Collapse (18:00 – 20:00 IST):&lt;/b&gt; &amp;alpha; = &lt;b&gt;0.22&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="305" width="990" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase3_p3_3" parent="phase3_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;3.3 Continuous 15-Minute Spline Interpolation (96 Blocks)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.5;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Native NWP Timestamps:&lt;/b&gt; 24 hourly steps (h = 0, 1, ..., 23) ingested from Open-Meteo Premium API.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Grid Alignment:&lt;/b&gt; Interpolated to 96 continuous 15-minute dispatch blocks (b = 1..96).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Interpolation Method:&lt;/b&gt; np.interp linear &amp; PCHIP Hermite spline with boundary preservation.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Solar Bypass:&lt;/b&gt; Strictly NO night zeroing; nocturnal wind generation fully active.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="520" width="990" height="135" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase4_container" parent="1" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAF5FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2.5;startSize=50;arcSize=6;shadow=1;collapsible=0;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px; color:#6B21A8;&quot;&gt;PHASE 4: DIURNAL SLOT SELECTION &amp; MULTI-MEMBER BASE ENSEMBLING&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="3580" y="140" width="1040" height="2200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase4_pill" parent="phase4_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E8FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#6B21A8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12.5;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" value="MODULE CONTEXT: get_wind_slot_for_block() :: Nocturnal Jet, Morning Decay, Daytime Lull, Evening Ramp" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="65" width="990" height="35" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase4_p4_1" parent="phase4_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;4.1 Diurnal Wind Regimes &amp; Temporal Slot Partitioning&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;table style='width:100%; font-size:11px; color:#0F172A; border-collapse:collapse;'&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#F1F5F9; color:#0F172A; font-weight:bold;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #CBD5E1;'&gt;Parameter&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #CBD5E1;'&gt;Value / Range&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #CBD5E1;'&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Aerodynamic Function&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#FFFFFF;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;nocturnal_jet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;20:00 to 05:30 IST (Blocks 81–96, 1–22)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;Thermal inversion low-level jet streaming; highest peak velocity.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#F8FAFC;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;morning_decay&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;05:30 to 08:30 IST (Blocks 23–34)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;Sunrise thermal mixing breakdown; rapid velocity dissipation ramp.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#FFFFFF;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;daytime_lull&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;08:30 to 18:15 IST (Blocks 35–73)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;Convective solar mixing drag; low generation wind doldrums.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style='background:#F8FAFC;'&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;evening_ramp&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;18:15 to 20:00 IST (Blocks 74–80)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='padding:5px; border:1px solid #E2E8F0;'&gt;Solar radiation cessation; rapid surface cooling &amp; kinetic acceleration.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="115" width="990" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase4_p4_2" parent="phase4_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;4.2 Slot-Wise Top Champion Selection vs Full Ensemble&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.5;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Champion Selection Mode:&lt;/b&gt; Dynamically selects the 5 historically lowest-error members per diurnal slot for Class S machines.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Nocturnal Champions:&lt;/b&gt; ECMWF IFS-EPS members (e.g. member18, member21, member28, member13, member40).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Daytime Champions:&lt;/b&gt; NCEP GEFS members (e.g. member03, member10, member28, member05, member02).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Base Synthesis Formula:&lt;/b&gt; v_base(b) = (1/5) &amp;sum; v_champion(b) in slot mode; otherwise full 143-member ensemble average.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Synthetic Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; v_fallback(b) = 4.5 + 2.5 &amp;middot; sin( 2&amp;pi;(b+12)/96 ) if all upstream NWP APIs fail.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="310" width="990" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase5_container" parent="1" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0F9FF;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2.5;startSize=50;arcSize=6;shadow=1;collapsible=0;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px; color:#0369A1;&quot;&gt;PHASE 5: SCADA TELEMETRY INGESTION &amp; CLOSED-LOOP BIAS BLENDING&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="4740" y="140" width="1040" height="2200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase5_pill" parent="phase5_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E0F2FE;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0369A1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12.5;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" value="MODULE CONTEXT: apply_dynamic_bias_and_telemetry_blending() :: Recency-Weighted Bias &amp; Momentum Nudge" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="65" width="990" height="35" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase5_p5_1" parent="phase5_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;5.1 Dual-Path SCADA Telemetry Extraction (extract_scada_wind_telemetry)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.5;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Nacelle Anemometers:&lt;/b&gt; Scans for turbine nacelle columns (Wind Speed_TPJ...). Trims top 2 &amp; bottom 2 outliers, returning trimmed mean.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Ground Mast Telemetry:&lt;/b&gt; If nacelle data absent, ingests mast sensor and scales by shear factor (&amp;times;2.108 for 10m &amp;rarr; 133m).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Active Power Telemetry:&lt;/b&gt; Ingests live MW generation, converting kW &amp;rarr; MW if value &amp;gt; 500.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Offline Fallback Mode:&lt;/b&gt; If SCADA missing/corrupt, telemetry sets = &amp;empty;; pipeline seamlessly continues with pure NWP.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="115" width="990" height="155" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase5_p5_2" parent="phase5_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=15;spacingRight=15;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13.5px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;5.2 Closed-Loop Dynamic Bias Correction &amp; Momentum Blending&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #CBD5E1; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='background:#F8FAFC; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:7px; border-radius:4px; font-family:monospace; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A; margin:6px 0; font-size:13px; text-align:center;'&gt;live_bias = &amp;sum; [ w_k &amp;middot; (v_model[k] &amp;minus; v_scada[k]) ] / &amp;sum; w_k&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11.5px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.55; margin-top:5px;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Historical Infill:&lt;/b&gt; For b &amp;le; current_block, model speed is replaced by actual SCADA speed.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Recency-Weighted Bias:&lt;/b&gt; Evaluated across last 8 blocks with exponential weight w_k = exp(k &amp;middot; 0.4).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Exponential Future Decay (&amp;tau; = 8 blocks / 2.0h):&lt;/b&gt; v_corr(b) = max(0, v_model[b] &amp;minus; live_bias &amp;middot; exp(&amp;minus;(b&amp;minus;b_curr)/8))&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Three-Block Telemetry Nudge:&lt;/b&gt; Blends immediate upcoming blocks: B+1 (70/30), B+2 (45/55), B+3 (20/80).&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="285" width="990" height="195" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase6_container" parent="1" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#E11D48;strokeWidth=2.5;startSize=50;arcSize=6;shadow=1;collapsible=0;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px; color:#9F1239;&quot;&gt;PHASE 6: JENSEN'S-INEQUALITY-SAFE POWER CURVE TRANSFORMATION&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="5900" y="140" width="1040" height="2200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase6_pill" parent="phase6_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE4E6;strokeColor=#E11D48;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#9F1239;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12.5;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" value="MODULE CONTEXT: turbine_power_curve() :: Member Velocity to MW Before Ensembling &amp; Park Derate" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="65" width="990" height="35" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase6_p6_1" parent="phase6_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E11D48;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;6.1 Jensen's-Inequality-Safe Power Transformation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.5;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;The Non-Linearity Problem:&lt;/b&gt; Wind turbine power is cubic in velocity: P &amp;prop; v&amp;sup3;. In probability theory: E[v&amp;sup3;] &amp;ge; (E[v])&amp;sup3;.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Severe Under-Forecasting:&lt;/b&gt; Averaging wind speeds first and passing the mean through a power curve causes 15% to 28% severe under-prediction.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Safe Transformation:&lt;/b&gt; Transforms each member velocity through the non-linear turbine power curve BEFORE ensembling/averaging.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Density Alignment:&lt;/b&gt; Applies IEC air density scaling to each member velocity prior to curve mapping.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="115" width="990" height="145" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase6_p6_2" parent="phase6_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E11D48;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=15;spacingRight=15;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13.5px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;6.2 Aerodynamic Power Curve &amp; Park Derating Pipeline&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #CBD5E1; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='background:#F8FAFC; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:7px; border-radius:4px; font-family:monospace; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A; margin:6px 0; font-size:13px; text-align:center;'&gt;P_net(b) = clip( P_gross( v_eff(b), &amp;rho;(b) ) &amp;times; &amp;eta;_park, 0.0, P_rated )&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11.5px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.55; margin-top:5px;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Tabular Non-Linear Curve Lookup:&lt;/b&gt; Evaluates v_eff through turbine empirical table (Class IIIA / Class S).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Cubic Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; P_gross = P_rated &amp;middot; [ (v_eff &amp;minus; v_in) / (v_rated &amp;minus; v_in) ]^2.8 for v_in &amp;le; v_eff &amp;lt; v_rated.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Park Derate Application:&lt;/b&gt; P_net(b) = clip( P_gross(b) &amp;times; &amp;eta;_park, 0.0, P_rated ) where &amp;eta;_park &amp;approx; 0.89.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Site Transfer Multipliers:&lt;/b&gt; P_final(b) = clip( round( P_net(b) &amp;times; M[b], 2 ), 0.0, P_rated ).&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="275" width="990" height="185" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase7_container" parent="1" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#F59E0B;strokeWidth=2.5;startSize=50;arcSize=6;shadow=1;collapsible=0;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px; color:#B45309;&quot;&gt;PHASE 7: STATUTORY LEAD TIME &amp; FREEZE BOUNDARY PARTITIONING&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="7060" y="140" width="1040" height="2200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase7_pill" parent="phase7_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#F59E0B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#B45309;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12.5;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" value="MODULE CONTEXT: AWS EventBridge 30-Min Cron Cadence &amp; 90-Min / 45-Min Effective Freeze Horizon" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="65" width="990" height="35" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase7_p7_1" parent="phase7_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#F59E0B;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;7.1 AWS EventBridge Automated Orchestration (31 Daily Rolling Gates)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #E2E8F0; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.5;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Schedule Cadence:&lt;/b&gt; Every 30 minutes from 06:00 to 21:00 IST across operating operating gates.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Dual Cron Rules:&lt;/b&gt; cron(30 0-15 * * ? *) (on the hour) &amp;amp; cron(0 1-15 * * ? *) (on the half-hour).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Invocation Event:&lt;/b&gt; Passes target date, revision timestamp, site ID, S3 bucket, and force execution flags.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Execution SLA:&lt;/b&gt; Containerized Lambda runs deterministic wind pipeline in &amp;lt; 4.5 seconds.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="115" width="990" height="145" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase7_p7_2" parent="phase7_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#F59E0B;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=15;spacingRight=15;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13.5px; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A;'&gt;7.2 Statutory Freeze Boundary Partitioning (T + Lag)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0.5px solid #CBD5E1; margin:4px 0;'&gt;&lt;div style='background:#F8FAFC; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:7px; border-radius:4px; font-family:monospace; font-weight:bold; color:#0F172A; margin:6px 0; font-size:13px; text-align:center;'&gt;freeze_from = target_time + timedelta(minutes = freeze_lag_minutes)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11.5px; color:#1E293B; line-height:1.55; margin-top:5px;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;MPERC Freeze Lag (e.g. MP State):&lt;/b&gt; Mandates &lt;b&gt;90-minute effective freeze horizon&lt;/b&gt; (T + 6 blocks).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CERC / Other State Rules:&lt;/b&gt; Mandates &lt;b&gt;45-minute freeze horizon&lt;/b&gt; (T + 3 blocks).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Partitioning Algorithm:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Immutable Frozen History (b &amp;lt; freeze_from):&lt;/b&gt; Preserved verbatim from previous current_final_schedule.csv.&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Actionable Dispatch Horizon (b &amp;ge; freeze_from):&lt;/b&gt; Populated with newly calibrated super-ensemble predictions.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="275" width="990" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase8_container" parent="1" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=2.5;startSize=50;arcSize=6;shadow=1;collapsible=0;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px; color:#166534;&quot;&gt;PHASE 8: 96-BLOCK MASTER ASSEMBLY, CERC GUARDRAILS &amp; S3 DISPATCH&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="8220" y="140" width="1040" height="2200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase8_pill" parent="phase8_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#166534;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12.5;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" value="MODULE CONTEXT: write_current_final_schedule() :: 5-Column CSV Master Schedule &amp; S3 Data Lake" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="65" width="990" height="35" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phase8_p8_1" parent="phase8_container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" value="&lt;div style='font-size:13px; fo